<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rembrandt Controlling lifts H1 shr, div.</title>
<headline>Rembrandt Controlling lifts H1 shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - pre-excepts	   129.4	 vs 94.8</p>
<p>    - post excepts	  142.9	 vs 95.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 21.77	 vs 18.14</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   514	   vs 344</p>
<p>Full name: Rembrandt Controlling Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The dividend was declared in August and paid in October.</p>
<p>The company holds just more than half of the ordinary shares of the Rembrandt Group Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
